<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Schedule A (Form 940) Template</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        td { padding: 5px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
        .header { font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">860306</div>
        <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 9pt;">OMB No. 1545-0028</div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Schedule A (Form 940) for 2006:</h1>
        <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;">Multi-State Employer and Credit Reduction Information</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Department of the Treasury - Internal Revenue Service</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <label for="ein">Employer identification number (EIN):</label>
            <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 300px; margin-left: 10px;">
                <span data-field="ein">{{ ein }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 11pt;">About this schedule:</h3>
        <ul style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">
            <li><span data-field="instruction_1">{{ instruction_1 }}</span> You must fill out Schedule A (Form 940) if you were required to pay your state unemployment tax in more than one state or if you paid wages in any state that is subject to credit reduction. For 2006, there are no states subject to credit reduction.</li>
            <li><span data-field="instruction_2">{{ instruction_2 }}</span> File Schedule A (Form 940) as an attachment to your Form 940.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">For more information, read the Instructions for Schedule A (Form 940) on the back.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 11pt;">Part I: Fill out this part if you were required to pay state unemployment taxes in more than one state (including the District of Columbia, Puerto Rico, and the U.S. Virgin Islands). If any states do NOT apply to you, leave them blank.</h3>

        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
