        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Note. Make sure that you have applied for a state unemployment number for your business. If you do not have an unemployment account number from a state in which you paid wages, contact the state office to receive one and enter "Applied For" on the appropriate line for the state. For a listing of states and contact information visit the Department of Labor's website at www.dol.gov.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">For ease of reference, here is a list of the states and their 2-letter postal abbreviations.</p>

